# Categories -- API_CONTRACT.md §6
#
# Run the dev database and the backend first:
#   docker compose -f compose.dev.yaml up -d
#   cd backend && mvn spring-boot:run
#
# Requests are ordered so they can be run top to bottom on a fresh database.
# {{id}} is captured from the create request below.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@id = 1

### List active categories -- 200, plain array (not paged)
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create -- 201 CategoryResponse + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fiction",
  "description": "Novels and short stories"
}

### Create a second one -- 201
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "History",
  "description": null
}

### Duplicate name, different case -- 409 CATEGORY_NAME_ALREADY_EXISTS (field: "name")
# Uniqueness is on lower(name) among active rows (ux_category_name_active).
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "fiction"
}

### Blank name -- 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (field: "name")
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### Two invalid fields -- 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, field is the alphabetically first ("description")
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": ""
}

### Get by id -- 200 CategoryResponse
GET {{host}}/api/categories/{{id}}

### Get by id, unknown -- 404 CATEGORY_NOT_FOUND
# An archived category answers the same way: it is not addressable.
GET {{host}}/api/categories/999999

### Get by id, non-numeric -- 400 VALIDATION_ERROR (field: "id")
GET {{host}}/api/categories/abc

### Update -- 200 CategoryResponse
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fiction",
  "description": "Novels, novellas and short stories"
}

### Update to a name another active category already uses -- 409 CATEGORY_NAME_ALREADY_EXISTS
PUT {{host}}/api/categories/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "History"
}

### Archive (soft delete) an empty category -- 204 No Content
# There is no restore endpoint: an archive done in error is re-created (DATA_MODEL.md §4.1).
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/{{id}}

### Archive a category that still has active books -- 409 CATEGORY_HAS_BOOKS
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/2
